AdvancedFlightComputer.Guidance.Tests/Scvx/python_ref/cone_dump.txt
AdvancedFlightComputer.Guidance.Tests/Scvx/python_ref/canon_dump.txt

## Build results
*.dll
*.exe
*.pdb
# C# OUTPUT, not a fixture: written by `Scvx.Console --loop` for plot_compare.py.
# Regenerated by any run, so committing it just churns the diff.
AdvancedFlightComputer.Guidance.Tests/Scvx/python_ref/loop_cs.csv

## IDE
**/Properties/launchSettings.json
# NOT ignored, deliberately, unlike AdvancedFlightComputer.Guidance.Tests/Gfold/python_ref/*.csv above:
# AdvancedFlightComputer.Guidance.Tests/Scvx/python_ref/dyn_ref.csv, sub_ref.csv and loop_ref.csv are small
# FIXTURES, not outputs - they are the JAX/CVXPY oracles the C# checks diff
# against. Committing them means `Scvx.Console --verbose`, `--sub-scs`, `--loop`
# and `--rh` run standalone; regenerating them needs JAX + cvxpy, which is a
# heavy dependency to force on anyone who just wants to run the tests.
# loop_ref.csv also carries the `# consts` line the drift guard asserts against.

## OS
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store
# Python environments and caches are local validation inputs.
# Reference fixtures are under AdvancedFlightComputer.Guidance.Tests.
# Keep generated environments outside version control.
**/.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Cargo's build tree for the vendored Clarabel crate. (The DLL it produces lands in
# build/native/, already ignored above with every other built native.)
third_party/clarabel/rust_wrapper/target/

# CMake out-of-source build dir in the vendored Clarabel tree. build-clarabel.ps1 uses
# cargo directly and never invokes CMake, but clarabel/CMakeLists.txt is checked in, so
# a manual `cmake -B build` there would otherwise land untracked. (scs/.gitignore
# already covers the equivalent for SCS, along with its *.o/*.a/out.)
third_party/clarabel/build/

# Vendored upstream CI. GitHub only ever reads .github/workflows at the REPO ROOT, so
# these never ran here - they were removed after the import, and this keeps re-vendoring
# Clarabel or SCS from quietly bringing 17 dead workflow files back.
third_party/**/.github/workflows/

## Scratch
# No .log or .tmp is tracked anywhere in this repo; both are output by definition.
*.log
*.tmp

# The independent local harness is never part of this public repository.
AdvancedFlightComputer.Harness/
